  "Ten more nights of driving and measuring for three jobs.",
  "Now keep the twenty and close five in ten.",
  "That's ten jobs. No new ad spend.",
  "Real talk, no tool closes a bad fit.",
  "But most of your losses aren't bad fits.",
  "They just couldn't see the finished room.",
  "Our own remodeling company went from three in ten to five or six in ten.",
  "Your first tour is free. Link in bio."
